% Minimal correction to AF7R58ZZV.
%
% Root cause:
%   validate_active_speed_certificate() was changed to require the runtime
%   function-handle/signature cache, but constructor order calls that
%   validator while building trigger_sweep_inflation BEFORE
%   runtime_dependency_signature is captured.
%
% Fix:
%   - constructor/pre-cache validation uses the original exact func2str()
%     comparison once;
%   - after runtime cache creation, cached handle/signature binding is used;
%   - Flight hot guard remains allocation-light and does NOT call func2str()
%     every cycle.
%
% No timing architecture or safety theorem is changed.
% No worker is introduced.
% H=4 s, finite sensing, staged pipeline and continuous certificate unchanged.

PRE_SHA='cbc183990c230078d61f01ab5157802036cc20dac6738e1f6465e7a7b212cff3';
